# =============================================================================
# Sim V2 - Environment Variable Reference
# =============================================================================
# This file is DOCUMENTATION ONLY. Do NOT create a root .env.
#
# Each app owns its own .env:
#   apps/api/.env   — Backend: DB, API keys, secrets
#   apps/web/.env   — Frontend: VITE_* feature flags
#
# packages/db/ has NO .env — it receives DATABASE_URL from the API at runtime.
#
# See apps/api/.env.example and apps/web/.env.example for templates.
# =============================================================================
